---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - FinCompute">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-sm text-body leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.6px] text-ink mb-8">Privacy Policy.</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-mute font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Last updated: July 10, 2026</p>
    
    <p>
      At FinCompute, we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and process your information when you use our suite of web-based financial calculators.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect any personal identity information. All calculations are executed entirely inside your local web browser using JavaScript. No transaction values, financial profiles, incomes, or debts are ever transmitted to our servers or stored by us.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">2. Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
      We use local web storage (like <code>localStorage</code>) strictly to preserve your application settings, such as your light/dark mode configuration. This data remains on your physical device.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">3. Third-Party Scripts</h2>
    <p>
      We may load standard design assets and fonts from public content delivery networks (like CDNJS or JSDelivr) to optimize page loading speed. These networks may log standard connection headers (like IP addresses and browser types) for firewall security purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">4. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update our Privacy Policy occasionally. We will post any changes directly on this page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy statement, you can reach us at privacy@fincompute.com.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
